    <h2>Your Options from Udaipur Airport to Chittorgarh</h2>

    <h3>1. Pre-booked private taxi (recommended)</h3>
    <p>
        A pre-booked taxi is the fastest and most comfortable option. Your driver waits at arrivals, helps with luggage and
        drives you straight to your home or hotel in Chittorgarh. There is no bargaining at the airport and no detour through
        Udaipur city.
    </p>

    <h3>2. Airport taxi counter</h3>
    <p>
        Taxis are available at the airport, but outstation fares to Chittorgarh can vary and availability of larger cars is not
        guaranteed, particularly for late-night flights.
    </p>

    <h3>3. Bus or train</h3>
    <p>
        There is no direct public transport from the airport to Chittorgarh. You would first need to go about 22 km into
        Udaipur city and then catch a bus or train back the way you came &ndash; which adds hours to the journey.
    </p>

